/ActualText (This was an assignment for my Dynamics and Control Systems lab. Here, we had to verify the results of an academic paper, in which they used the Windkessel model, an RLC analog to model the blood flow through the body, where R was fluid resistance, L was blood inertia, and C was the elasticity of the veins. The heart was the voltage source.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
