/ActualText (The arm had 3 main requirements: It had to be able to easily reach the ground, It had to easily be able to reach 1.5m up from the ground, and it had to fold up when not in use \(especially when the rover itself was moving\). Those geometric constraints are shown in the sketch below. All subsequent parts and assemblies were defined around that sketch.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
