521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The concept can now be expanded to the more complex 4-bar mechanism. The input torque, T_motor, which controls theta_2 comes from the elbow motor. The output force is F_Load, which will come from whatever the arm is carrying. The MA_torqueToForce will be the ratio of T_motor to F_Load.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [9]
