/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I thought it would be efficient to use heavy M12 screws as both a way to secure parts together, as well as an axle. Normally, tightening something would make it resistant to movement, and would add heavy friction. However, I did some creative things to get around this.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
