/S /P
/ActualText (Then, using a given starting point to generate a curve, I just numerically integrated to get the actual Power vs Time, and then numerically integrated again to get the actual energy used in 1 hour. I tested a 1kW, 5,4kW, 5,5kW, and an 8kW start. )
