/ActualText (This was a small project for my Vibrations class - recently learning state space modeling, we were tasked with plotting the positions and accelerations of a 2 mass car suspension. This is the first MATLAB file in which I call another file to use as a function. This is then plugged into ODE45, and solved. On the graph, the max points are located, and indicated in the legend using max\(\) and num2str\(\), as the code below the graph shows.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [13]
>>
