/ActualText (Although powerful and versatile, the Gauss-Jordan method is very tedious and repetitive. My professors always wanted me to show every single step of work when solving these, especially when dealing with transfer functions. Not wanting to do this repetitive task by hand, and not wanting to use the calculators online, I sought to write my own program that would not only solve the problem for me, but show each step itself. )
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
